# Tripo 3D assets

When creating, rebuilding, or debugging **Tripo / GLB** meshes for Ballkanone or Kettenhochhaus:

1. Read `.cursor/skills/tripo-3d-assets/SKILL.md` (and `pipeline.md` when baking)
2. Follow `docs/AGENT_OWNERS.md` — do not edit Stil-C `public/art/**` or minigame sim code
3. Keep realistic PBR materials; do not apply comic/toon conversion
4. Keep `ballkanone` and `kettenhochhaus` paths separate (concepts, tripo-out, models, bake scripts)
